-- Refrigeration or Air-Conditioning Systems Work Licensing Law, 5785-2025
-- חוק הסדרת העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר, התשפ"ה-2025
-- Sefer HaChukim 3349, p. 182, published 14 January 2025.
--
-- Scope of THIS module: the licensing chapter as far as the Fees Regulations
-- lean on it -- s.2 grades, s.3 licensing requirement, ss.5-9 application,
-- conditions, exemptions, validity and the foreign-expert temporary licence,
-- s.16 change-of-details duty, s.17 continuing education, s.63 commencement,
-- and the Second Schedule routes into s.6(a)(4). Chapter F (administrative
-- enforcement) is deliberately NOT here.
--
-- Source of every English sentence below: our own translation of the Hebrew;
-- the Hebrew heralds (@nlg:he) reuse the statute's own words where they fit.
@lang en

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

§ `Chapter A -- Purpose and definitions`
§§ `s.2 Definitions -- licence grades`

-- "רישיון דרגה 1" -- up to 18 kW; "רישיון דרגה 2" -- up to 70 kW; "רישיון דרגה 3" -- any system.
DECLARE Grade IS ONE OF `Grade 1`, `Grade 2`, `Grade 3`

GIVEN kw IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Grade
DECIDE `the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` @nlg the lowest licence grade that may work on a system whose cooling output is %kw% kW
                                                          @nlg:he דרגת הרישיון הנמוכה ביותר המתירה עבודה במערכת שתפוקת הקירור שלה %kw% קילו־ואט
    IS BRANCH IF kw AT MOST 18 THEN `Grade 1`
              IF kw AT MOST 70 THEN `Grade 2`
              OTHERWISE            `Grade 3`

GIVEN grade IS A Grade
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rank of` grade MEANS
    CONSIDER grade
    WHEN `Grade 1` THEN 1
    WHEN `Grade 2` THEN 2
    WHEN `Grade 3` THEN 3

GIVEN grade IS A Grade
      kw    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a licence of the grade permits work on the system` @nlg a %grade% licence permits work on a system whose cooling output is %kw% kW
                                                          @nlg:he רישיון %grade% מתיר עבודה במערכת שתפוקת הקירור שלה %kw% קילו־ואט
    IF `the rank of` grade AT LEAST `the rank of` (`the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` kw)

§ `Chapter B -- Licensing`
§§ `s.3 Duty to hold a licence`

-- s.3(a): a person shall not perform work of a kind listed in column B of the
-- First Schedule on a system unless holding a licence of the type in column A
-- suited to that system. The First Schedule's lists of WORKS per grade are not
-- modelled (NOTES.md section 7), so this rule answers only the cooling-output
-- half of s.3(a): whether the licence grade reaches the system. Whether the
-- particular action is one that grade may perform is a separate question.
-- s.3(b), the Minister's power to exempt system types by order, is an input.
GIVEN licence IS A MAYBE Grade
      kw      IS A NUMBER
      `the system type is exempted by order under s.3(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the licence grade reaches the system` @nlg the person's licence, if any, is of a grade that reaches a system of %kw% kW, or the system is exempted by order
                                             @nlg:he רישיונו של האדם, אם יש לו, הוא מדרגה המגיעה למערכת של %kw% קילו־ואט, או שסוג המערכת פטור בצו
    IF     `the system type is exempted by order under s.3(b)`
        OR CONSIDER licence
           WHEN JUST grade THEN `a licence of the grade permits work on the system` grade kw
           WHEN NOTHING    THEN FALSE

§§ `s.6 Conditions for the grant of a licence, with the Second Schedule`

-- s.6(a)(4) sends the applicant to the Second Schedule, whose column A is the
-- applicant's prior training or experience and whose column B is what they must
-- then hold. These are the column A entries, across all three parts. The chapeau
-- of s.6(a)(4) -- "והכול בהתאם לתנאים שבתוספת השנייה" -- subjects all three of
-- its limbs to the Schedule, so registration in the technicians and engineers
-- registry (limb (b)) is a column A entry here, not a free-standing route.
-- Part B item 2 and Part C item 2 name the registration AND completion of a
-- study programme including the completion course; a registrant without that
-- course falls under Part B item 6 or Part C item 7 instead.
DECLARE `Prior qualification` IS ONE OF
    `no prior training or experience`
    `qualifying experience`                                     -- one year in the last three, or three in the last seven
    `Division completion certificate, refrigeration and air conditioning`
    `Division completion certificate, grade 1`
    `Division completion certificate, grade 2`
    `Division youth vocational school completion certificate`
    `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 3 units`
    `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 5 units`
    `holds a Grade 1 licence`
    `holds a Grade 2 licence`
    `registered certified technician, refrigeration and air conditioning`
    `registered certified technician, having completed a study programme with the completion course`
    `registered practical engineer, refrigeration and air conditioning`
    `registered practical engineer, having completed a study programme with the completion course`
    `registered engineer, mechanical branch`

-- Column B, reduced to what it asks of the applicant.
DECLARE Requirement IS ONE OF
    `training of up to`             HAS hours IS A NUMBER      -- a Division course of at most this many hours, conferring the completion certificate
    `no further requirements`
    `no route in the Second Schedule`

GIVEN grade IS A Grade
      prior IS A `Prior qualification`
GIVETH A Requirement
DECIDE `the Second Schedule requires, for the grade, of an applicant with` @nlg what the Second Schedule requires of an applicant for a %grade% licence whose prior qualification is %prior%
                                                                          @nlg:he מה שהתוספת השנייה דורשת ממבקש רישיון %grade% שהכשרתו או ניסיונו הקודמים הם %prior%
    IS CONSIDER grade
       WHEN `Grade 1` THEN `Part A -- Grade 1` prior
       WHEN `Grade 2` THEN `Part B -- Grade 2` prior
       WHEN `Grade 3` THEN `Part C -- Grade 3` prior
    WHERE
        GIVEN p IS A `Prior qualification`
        `Part A -- Grade 1` p MEANS
            CONSIDER p
            WHEN `no prior training or experience`                                  THEN `training of up to` 350   -- item 1; or the MoE 3-unit certificate
            WHEN `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 3 units`       THEN `no further requirements` -- item 1(2)
            WHEN `qualifying experience`                                            THEN `training of up to` 220   -- item 2, time-limited
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, refrigeration and air conditioning` THEN `training of up to` 50 -- item 3
            OTHERWISE                                                                    `no route in the Second Schedule`

        GIVEN p IS A `Prior qualification`
        `Part B -- Grade 2` p MEANS
            CONSIDER p
            WHEN `no prior training or experience`                                  THEN `training of up to` 480   -- item 1; or the MoE 5-unit certificate
            WHEN `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 5 units`       THEN `training of up to` 50    -- item 5(3); but see fork F4: item 1(2) lists the same certificate as sufficient
            WHEN `registered certified technician, having completed a study programme with the completion course` THEN `no further requirements` -- item 2
            WHEN `registered certified technician, refrigeration and air conditioning` THEN `training of up to` 50    -- item 6
            WHEN `holds a Grade 1 licence`                                          THEN `training of up to` 100   -- item 3
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, grade 1`                         THEN `training of up to` 100   -- item 3
            WHEN `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 3 units`       THEN `training of up to` 100   -- item 3
            WHEN `qualifying experience`                                            THEN `training of up to` 330   -- item 4, time-limited
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, refrigeration and air conditioning` THEN `training of up to` 50 -- item 5
            WHEN `Division youth vocational school completion certificate`          THEN `training of up to` 50    -- item 5
            OTHERWISE                                                                    `no route in the Second Schedule`

        GIVEN p IS A `Prior qualification`
        `Part C -- Grade 3` p MEANS
            CONSIDER p
            WHEN `no prior training or experience`                                  THEN `training of up to` 720   -- item 1
            WHEN `registered practical engineer, having completed a study programme with the completion course` THEN `no further requirements` -- item 2
            WHEN `registered practical engineer, refrigeration and air conditioning` THEN `training of up to` 50    -- item 7
            WHEN `holds a Grade 1 licence`                                          THEN `training of up to` 290   -- item 3
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, grade 1`                         THEN `training of up to` 290   -- item 3
            WHEN `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 3 units`       THEN `training of up to` 290   -- item 3
            WHEN `holds a Grade 2 licence`                                          THEN `training of up to` 240   -- item 4
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, grade 2`                         THEN `training of up to` 240   -- item 4
            WHEN `Ministry of Education climate-control certificate, 5 units`       THEN `training of up to` 240   -- item 4
            WHEN `qualifying experience`                                            THEN `training of up to` 455   -- item 5, time-limited
            WHEN `Division completion certificate, refrigeration and air conditioning` THEN `training of up to` 200 -- item 6
            WHEN `registered engineer, mechanical branch`                            THEN `training of up to` 230   -- item 8
            OTHERWISE                                                                    `no route in the Second Schedule`

-- The experience-only rows (Part A item 2, Part B item 4, Part C item 5) each
-- carry the note "this provision stands for three years from the commencement
-- day under s.63(a)(1)". Nothing else in the Schedule is time-limited.
GIVEN prior IS A `Prior qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the route is time-limited` @nlg the Second Schedule route for %prior% lapses three years after the commencement day
                                  @nlg:he מסלול התוספת השנייה למי ש%prior% עומד בתוקף שלוש שנים מיום התחילה בלבד
    IF prior EQUALS `qualifying experience`

GIVEN prior IS A `Prior qualification`
      `commencement day` IS A DATE
      `application date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the route is open on the application date` @nlg the Second Schedule route for %prior% is still open on %`application date`%
                                                   @nlg:he מסלול התוספת השנייה למי ש%prior% עדיין פתוח ביום %`application date`%
    IF     NOT `the route is time-limited` prior
        OR `application date` LESS THAN `add years` `commencement day` 3

DECLARE Applicant HAS
    `is an adult`                                   IS A BOOLEAN            -- s.6(a)(1)
    `is an Israeli citizen or resident`             IS A BOOLEAN            -- s.6(a)(2)
    `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment` IS A BOOLEAN -- s.6(a)(3), in the registrar's judgement
    `holds a completion certificate for the grade`  IS A BOOLEAN            -- s.6(a)(4)(a): the s.2 "תעודת גמר"
    `prior qualifications`                          IS A LIST OF `Prior qualification` -- column A of the Second Schedule; registry membership, s.6(a)(4)(b), is one of them
    `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires` IS A BOOLEAN -- s.6(a)(4)(c)

GIVEN a IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the applicant satisfies the personal conditions` @nlg the applicant is an adult, an Israeli citizen or resident, and not unfit by reason of a conviction
                                                        @nlg:he המבקש בגיר, אזרח ישראלי או תושב ישראל, ואינו בלתי ראוי מפאת הרשעה או כתב אישום
    IF      a's `is an adult`
        AND a's `is an Israeli citizen or resident`
        AND NOT a's `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment`

-- One prior qualification, one row of the Schedule: is that row open, and is
-- its column B met?
GIVEN a     IS AN Applicant
      grade IS A Grade
      `commencement day` IS A DATE
      `application date` IS A DATE
      prior IS A `Prior qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the applicant qualifies through the Schedule row for` @nlg the applicant, relying on %prior%, meets the Second Schedule for a %grade% licence on %`application date`%
                                                             @nlg:he המבקש, בהסתמך על %prior%, עומד בתוספת השנייה לרישיון %grade% ביום %`application date`%
    IF      `the route is open on the application date` prior `commencement day` `application date`
        AND CONSIDER `the Second Schedule requires, for the grade, of an applicant with` grade prior
            WHEN `no further requirements`         THEN TRUE
            WHEN `training of up to` hours         THEN a's `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires`
            WHEN `no route in the Second Schedule` THEN FALSE

-- s.6(a)(4): limb (a), or any row of the Schedule the applicant's prior
-- qualifications open -- limbs (b) and (c) both live there.
GIVEN a     IS AN Applicant
      grade IS A Grade
      `commencement day` IS A DATE
      `application date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the applicant satisfies the training condition` @nlg the applicant meets s.6(a)(4) for a %grade% licence
                                                       @nlg:he המבקש עומד בתנאי סעיף 6(א)(4) לרישיון %grade%
    IF      a's `holds a completion certificate for the grade`                          -- (a)
        OR  any (GIVEN p YIELD `the applicant qualifies through the Schedule row for` a grade `commencement day` `application date` p)
                (a's `prior qualifications`)                                             -- (b), (c)

@export Whether the registrar must grant a refrigeration or air-conditioning work licence of the requested grade to this applicant (s.6 of the Law with the Second Schedule)
GIVEN a     IS AN Applicant   @desc the applicant's facts under s.6(a)(1)-(4)
      grade IS A Grade        @desc the licence grade applied for: Grade 1 (up to 18 kW), Grade 2 (up to 70 kW) or Grade 3 (any system)
      `commencement day` IS A DATE @desc the day the Law commenced under s.63(a)(1); 2025-07-16 as things stand
      `application date` IS A DATE @desc the date the application was submitted
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the registrar shall grant the licence` @nlg the registrar shall grant a %grade% licence to the applicant
                                              @nlg:he הרשם ייתן למבקש רישיון %grade%
    IF      `the applicant satisfies the personal conditions` a
        AND `the applicant satisfies the training condition` a grade `commencement day` `application date`

§§ `s.7 Exemptions from parts of the training`

GIVEN `holds a valid electricity licence`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `holds a valid work-at-height certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`the chapters the Division director may exempt the applicant from` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `holds a valid electricity licence` AND `holds a valid work-at-height certificate`
                THEN LIST "the electricity chapter", "the work-at-height chapter"
           IF `holds a valid electricity licence`        THEN LIST "the electricity chapter"
           IF `holds a valid work-at-height certificate` THEN LIST "the work-at-height chapter"
           OTHERWISE EMPTY

§§ `s.8 Period of validity and renewal`

-- "תוקפו של רישיון יהיה לחמש שנים או עד 31 במרץ של השנה החמישית מהשנה שבה ניתן
-- הרישיון, לפי המוקדם". Reading adopted (fork F1 in NOTES.md): the fifth year
-- FROM the grant year is grant year + 5.
GIVEN grant IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the licence expires on` @nlg a licence granted on %grant% expires on the earlier of five years from grant and 31 March of the fifth year after the grant year
                               @nlg:he רישיון שניתן ביום %grant% פוקע במוקדם מבין חמש שנים ממתן הרישיון ו־31 במרץ של השנה החמישית מהשנה שבה ניתן
    IS IF   `five years from grant` LESS THAN `31 March of the fifth year`
       THEN `five years from grant`
       ELSE `31 March of the fifth year`
    WHERE
        `five years from grant`    MEANS `add years` grant 5
        `31 March of the fifth year` MEANS YMD (DATE_YEAR grant PLUS 5) 3 31

-- Renewal: the s.6 conditions again, except s.6(a)(4).
GIVEN a IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the licence may be renewed` @nlg the licence may be renewed, the s.6 conditions other than the training condition being met
                                   @nlg:he ניתן לחדש את הרישיון, בהתקיים תנאי סעיף 6 למעט תנאי ההכשרה
    IF `the applicant satisfies the personal conditions` a

§§ `s.9 Temporary licence for a foreign expert`

DECLARE `Foreign expert` HAS
    `was invited to Israel for work on a system of` IS A NUMBER  -- kW, s.9(a)(1): must exceed 70
    `is authorised abroad and did similar work in the six years before applying` IS A BOOLEAN -- s.9(a)(2)
    `is recognised by the registrar as of repute and expertise` IS A BOOLEAN -- s.9(a)(3)

GIVEN e IS A `Foreign expert`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the registrar may grant a temporary Grade 3 licence` @nlg the registrar may grant the foreign expert a temporary Grade 3 licence for up to one year
                                                            @nlg:he הרשם רשאי לתת למומחה הזר רישיון דרגה 3 זמני לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה
    IF      e's `was invited to Israel for work on a system of` GREATER THAN 70
        AND e's `is authorised abroad and did similar work in the six years before applying`
        AND e's `is recognised by the registrar as of repute and expertise`

-- s.9(b): renewable for two further periods of at most one year each.
GIVEN `renewals already granted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a further renewal of the temporary licence is available` @nlg the temporary licence may be renewed again, %`renewals already granted`% renewals having been granted
                                                                @nlg:he ניתן לחדש שוב את הרישיון הזמני, לאחר %`renewals already granted`% חידושים
    IF `renewals already granted` LESS THAN 2

GIVEN `first granted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the latest day a temporary licence can run to` @nlg the latest day to which a temporary licence first granted on %`first granted`% can be extended by its two renewals
                                                      @nlg:he היום המאוחר ביותר שאליו ניתן להאריך רישיון זמני שניתן לראשונה ביום %`first granted`% בשני חידושיו
    IS `add years` `first granted` 3

§ `Chapter C -- Duties of a licence holder`
§§ `s.16 Duty to report a change of details`

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF `the licence holder`, `the registrar`
DECLARE Act   IS ONE OF `notify the registrar of the change`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`the duty to report a change of registered details` MEANS
    PARTY  `the licence holder`
    MUST   `notify the registrar of the change`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the licence holder` BECAUSE "s.16: the change of details was not reported to the registrar within 30 days"

§§ `s.17 Continuing education`

-- s.17(a): at least eight hours, in courses the Ministry supervises or the
-- Division recognises, in the licence holder's field under the licence, in the
-- final year of validity, AND meeting those courses' requirements. s.17(d)
-- deems this duty a condition of the licence, which is how it reaches renewal
-- (s.8) and the registrar's powers (s.10(a)).
GIVEN `hours of recognised training in the final year of validity` IS A NUMBER
      `the training was in the field of the licence`               IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holder met the requirements of those courses`          IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the continuing-education duty is met` @nlg the licence holder took at least eight hours of recognised training in the field of the licence in its last year, and met the courses' requirements
                                             @nlg:he בעל הרישיון השתתף בהשתלמויות מוכרות בהיקף של שמונה שעות לפחות בתחום עיסוקו לפי רישיונו בשנה האחרונה לתוקפו, ועמד בדרישותיהן
    IF      `hours of recognised training in the final year of validity` AT LEAST 8
        AND `the training was in the field of the licence`
        AND `the holder met the requirements of those courses`

-- s.17(c): where the holder has NOT met the duty under (a) or (b), the registrar
-- may, after consulting the council, in special cases and justified
-- circumstances, extend validity by at most three months so it can be met.
GIVEN `months of extension sought`                  IS A NUMBER
      `the duty under s.17(a) or (b) is unmet`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `the council has been consulted`              IS A BOOLEAN
      `the case is special and the circumstances justify it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the registrar may extend validity by` @nlg the registrar may extend the licence by %`months of extension sought`% months for the training to be completed
                                             @nlg:he הרשם רשאי להאריך את תוקף הרישיון ב־%`months of extension sought`% חודשים לשם השלמת ההשתלמות
    IF      `the duty under s.17(a) or (b) is unmet`
        AND `the council has been consulted`
        AND `the case is special and the circumstances justify it`
        AND `months of extension sought` GREATER THAN 0
        AND `months of extension sought` AT MOST 3

§ `Chapter G -- Miscellaneous`
§§ `s.63 Commencement`

-- s.63(a)(1): for systems using a flammable refrigerant in the Fourth Schedule,
-- three months from publication or the commencement of the fee regulations
-- under s.59, whichever is later -- "the commencement day".
GIVEN published IS A DATE
      `fee regulations in force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the commencement day` @nlg the Law's commencement day, given publication on %published% and the fee regulations in force from %`fee regulations in force`%
                             @nlg:he יום התחילה של החוק, בהינתן פרסומו ביום %published% ותחילת תקנות האגרות ביום %`fee regulations in force`%
    IS IF   `three months from publication` GREATER THAN `fee regulations in force`
       THEN `three months from publication`
       ELSE `fee regulations in force`
    WHERE
        `three months from publication` MEANS `add months` published 3

-- s.63(a)(2): for every other system, 18 months from the commencement day.
GIVEN `commencement day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the Law applies to non-flammable-refrigerant systems from` @nlg the Law applies to systems on other refrigerants from eighteen months after %`commencement day`%
                                                                  @nlg:he החוק חל על מערכות בקרר שאינו דליק החל ב־18 חודשים מיום %`commencement day`%
    IS `add months` `commencement day` 18

-- s.63(b): Chapter F commences 18 months from the commencement day or when the
-- regulations under s.46 take effect, whichever is later.
GIVEN `commencement day` IS A DATE
      `s.46 regulations in force` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Chapter F commences on` @nlg the day the administrative-enforcement chapter commences
                               @nlg:he היום שבו מתחיל פרק ו׳, האכיפה המינהלית
    IS CONSIDER `s.46 regulations in force`
       WHEN NOTHING  THEN NOTHING
       WHEN JUST r   THEN JUST (IF r GREATER THAN eighteen THEN r ELSE eighteen)
    WHERE
        eighteen MEANS `add months` `commencement day` 18

§ `Illustrations`

`the gazette date`       MEANS YMD 2025 1 14
`the fee regulations day` MEANS YMD 2025 7 16

#EVAL `the commencement day` `the gazette date` `the fee regulations day`
#ASSERT `the commencement day` `the gazette date` `the fee regulations day` EQUALS YMD 2025 7 16
#ASSERT `the Law applies to non-flammable-refrigerant systems from` (YMD 2025 7 16) EQUALS YMD 2027 1 16
#ASSERT `Chapter F commences on` (YMD 2025 7 16) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` 18 EQUALS `Grade 1`
#ASSERT `the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` 18.5 EQUALS `Grade 2`
#ASSERT `the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` 70 EQUALS `Grade 2`
#ASSERT `the lowest grade permitted to work on a system of` 70.5 EQUALS `Grade 3`
#ASSERT `the licence grade reaches the system` (JUST `Grade 2`) 65 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the licence grade reaches the system` (JUST `Grade 2`) 75 FALSE
#ASSERT `the licence grade reaches the system` NOTHING 75 TRUE

-- s.8: a licence granted after 31 March is cut short by the 31 March cap.
#EVAL `the licence expires on` (YMD 2025 9 1)
#ASSERT `the licence expires on` (YMD 2025 9 1)  EQUALS YMD 2030 3 31
#ASSERT `the licence expires on` (YMD 2025 1 15) EQUALS YMD 2030 1 15
#ASSERT `the licence expires on` (YMD 2025 3 31) EQUALS YMD 2030 3 31

`Dana` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `is an adult`                                   IS TRUE
    `is an Israeli citizen or resident`             IS TRUE
    `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment` IS FALSE
    `holds a completion certificate for the grade`  IS FALSE
    `prior qualifications`                          IS LIST `qualifying experience`
    `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires` IS TRUE

-- Dana relies on the experience route, which lapses three years after 2025-07-16.
#ASSERT     `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Dana` `Grade 1` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2028 7 15)
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Dana` `Grade 1` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2028 7 16)
#EVAL `the Second Schedule requires, for the grade, of an applicant with` `Grade 3` `qualifying experience`

-- A registered technician: Grade 2 needs the completion course (item 2) or 50
-- hours (item 6); Grade 3 has no technician row at all; Part A has none either.
`Yossi` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `is an adult`                                   IS TRUE
    `is an Israeli citizen or resident`             IS TRUE
    `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment` IS FALSE
    `holds a completion certificate for the grade`  IS FALSE
    `prior qualifications`                          IS LIST `registered certified technician, refrigeration and air conditioning`
    `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi` `Grade 2` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi` `Grade 3` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi` `Grade 1` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
`Yossi, after the completion course` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `is an adult`                                   IS TRUE
    `is an Israeli citizen or resident`             IS TRUE
    `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment` IS FALSE
    `holds a completion certificate for the grade`  IS FALSE
    `prior qualifications`                          IS LIST `registered certified technician, having completed a study programme with the completion course`
    `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires` IS FALSE
#ASSERT     `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi, after the completion course` `Grade 2` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi, after the completion course` `Grade 3` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
-- Two prior qualifications: any open row will do.
`Yossi, who also has the experience` MEANS Applicant WITH
    `is an adult`                                   IS TRUE
    `is an Israeli citizen or resident`             IS TRUE
    `is unfit by reason of a conviction or pending indictment` IS FALSE
    `holds a completion certificate for the grade`  IS FALSE
    `prior qualifications`                          IS LIST `registered certified technician, refrigeration and air conditioning`, `qualifying experience`
    `completed the supplementary studies the Schedule requires` IS TRUE
#ASSERT     `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi, who also has the experience` `Grade 3` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2026 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar shall grant the licence` `Yossi, who also has the experience` `Grade 3` (YMD 2025 7 16) (YMD 2029 1 1)

#ASSERT     `the continuing-education duty is met` 8 TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the continuing-education duty is met` 8 FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar may extend validity by` 0 TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT     `the registrar may extend validity by` 3 TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the registrar may extend validity by` 3 FALSE TRUE TRUE

#TRACE `the duty to report a change of registered details` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the licence holder` DOES `notify the registrar of the change` AT 12
